        startLine: 595
      summary: "\nSuperficial structural check: non-empty and starts/ends with\nexpected delimiters.\n"
      remarks: "\n<p>\nThis method performs a superficial structural check on the JSON text.\nIt verifies that the JSON is non-empty and starts/ends with the expected\ndelimiters for either a JSON object or a JSON array.\n</p>\n<p>\nSince the primary purpose of this class is to ensure that the JsonConvert method \ncan safely parse the JSON, this check is intentionally superficial and does not\nguarantee full JSON validity.\n</p>\n"
      example: []
      syntax:
